TDIAL101

Please read the doc file before trying to use. If it looks intresting and
you have a printer available it would be advisable to print out before
trying to install.

Since the net has been having so many problems of late. I have enabled
flow control using set? 5:1<ret> in the script. Under some conditions
this will slow transfers. If things improve you may be able to speed up
transfers by disabling flow control as per the following:

<ctrl><end>         /* sends telenet a break */
set? 5:0<ret>       /* turn flow control off */
cont<ret>           /* continue              */


If you are entering PC Pursuit at 2400 and are connected to a remote
city and are using Zmodem you must leave flow control enabled.

